  "description": "Office Server Document Converter .NET Interface.\n    Office Server Document Converter (OSDC) is the library to convert MS Office (Word/Excel/PowerPoint) document, RTF, PDF, SVG, EMF, WMF, BMP, PNG, GIF, TIFF, JPG, JP2 and XDW files into PDF, SVG, JPEG, PNG, TIFF files on the server side. By using OSDC with groupware, webmail systems, etc., Microsoft Office and RTF documents can be easily converted even in environments where Microsoft Office and Adobe software are not installed.\n    OSDC direct conversion is a method that does not use the application from which the document was created, nor does it use printer drivers. Since Microsoft Office automation is not used on the server side, conversions can be done without worrying about its risks or licensing issues when used in the cloud. There is no need to install Microsoft Office, Adobe software, OpenOffice or LibreOffice to convert Office documents.",
  "iconFile": "Images\\OSDC-web-icon.png",
